    "notes": "Retained Q4355536 and OSM way 319542070 identify the structure. The November 9 Kosinjski most road trace establishes the signed frame. +X points north-northeast across the Lika. +Z points east-southeast across the deck. The mapped 73.029 m outline and the attributed road set the signed frame. Vault spans and stone details follow ordinary photographs. The plinth caps in the three nearest tiers sit approximately 0.235 m above the native water at the sampled tips. The skyline tier simplifies the plinth profile. The standard terrain places the south approach below the deck and produces a steep support face. Heights and river clearance are visualization measurements. Physical-device timings remain unmeasured."
  },
